      <activity id="97ba6fc1-973a-5dee-8149-2d3253abdbbf" activityNameId="6b0fb093-ed35-5722-8517-79132decb4a0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Refinery gas, burned in furnace</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Refinery gas, burned in furnace
Description of the direct emissions due to the combustion of refinery gas in refinery furnaces and generators not including the infrastructure of the furnace.;
UUID: 748e6c77-9e50-326e-83c8-21dcfaf75158
Consumption of refinery gas and combustion emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology in use.
Time period: New Swiss data for regulated emissions like CO2, NOx, SOx etc. have been provided by the refineries. They have been compared and discussed with older literature data.
Production volume: 168 thousand tonnes of refinery gas were burned in 2000.
Sampling: Literature survey and plant data. 
Extrapolations: Methane, CO, Hg and particulates are estimated with European figures.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_748e6c77-9e50-326e-83c8-21dcfaf75158.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
